{"id":"n67697-1-8","stage":1,"title":"여든 · 八十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67697-1-8-1","ko":"나는 평생 동안 그 책을 여든 번도 넘게 읽었어.","zh":"我这辈子已经读过那本书八十多次了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"평생","meaning":"平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子","explanation":"평생：平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子","readings":[{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71485","senseId":"1","lemma":"평생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책을","audio":"/audio/e44a325e9f08fbcedc00.mp3"}},{"text":"여든","meaning":"八十","explanation":"여든：八十","readings":[{"term":"여든","audio":"/audio/343cee874536d9eef8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67697","senseId":"1","lemma":"여든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여든","audi