ation":["여든"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定时间、时期或范围等。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc52ec54dcfd781a781b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67697-1-8-2","ko":"와, 아버지는 그럼 그 책 내용을 거의 외우시겠어요.","zh":"哇，那您应该几乎把那本书的内容都背下来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지는","audio":"/audio/c70c05233681f44d2334.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"책","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}},{"text":"내용을","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"3","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내용을","audio":"/audio/666977270e450d47deca.mp3"}},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"외우시겠어요.","meaning":"背，背诵","explanation":"외우다：背，背诵；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"외우다","audio":"/audio/b9471b1320d322b01853.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67856","senseId":"2","lemma":"외우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외우시겠어요","audio":"/audio/4e994961ab5b8e759edc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciat